    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我要用这个锅来煮螺蛳粉，\nwǒ yào yòng zhè gè guō lái zhǔ luó sī fěn，\nI’m going to use this pot to cook luosifen,"
