      "utf8": "把米粉和配菜都加进去，\nbǎ mǐ fěn hé pèi cài dū jiā jìn qù，\nadd the noodles and the side dishes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 600300,
    "dDurationMs": 1040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "加进去。\njiā jìn qù。\nadd them in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 601980,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我先把火关小一点，\nwǒ xiān bǎ huǒ guān xiǎo yī diǎn，\nI’ll turn the heat down a little first,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 605340,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "把火关小，\nbǎ huǒ guān xiǎo，\nturn the heat down,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 607820,
    "dDurationMs": 880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "关小火。\nguān xiǎo huǒ。\nturn down the heat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 610556,
    "dDurationMs": 2442,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我先把米粉，\nwǒ xiān bǎ mǐ fěn，\nFirst I’ll add the rice noodles,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 613398,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "先把米粉加进汤里，\nxiān bǎ mǐ fěn jiā jìn tāng lǐ，\nadd the rice noodles into the soup first,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 617158,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "把米粉加进去。\nbǎ mǐ fěn jiā jìn qù。\nadd the rice noodles in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 621713,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这是我昨天从餐厅\nzhè shì wǒ zuó tiān cóng cān tīng\nThis is what I got yesterday from the restaurant"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 625107,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "从外面的餐厅打包回来的菜\ncóng wài miàn de cān tīng dǎ bāo huí lái de cài\na dish I packed to go from a restaurant outside"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 630353,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "是两只鸡爪\nshì liǎng zhī jī zhǎo\nit’s two chicken feet"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 635233,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "两只鸡爪，昨天打包回来的，\nliǎng zhī jī zhǎo， zuó tiān dǎ bāo huí lái de，\ntwo chicken feet, packed up yesterday,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 640913,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "打包回来的鸡爪，\ndǎ bāo huí lái de jī zhǎo，\nthe chicken feet I packed to go,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 643176,
    "dDurationMs": 2857,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我也把它们加进汤里，\nwǒ yě bǎ tā men jiā jìn tāng lǐ，\nI’m adding them into the soup too,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 646273,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "放在粉里，\nfàng zài fěn lǐ，\nput them in the noodles,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 648673,
    "dDurationMs": 800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "加进去。\njiā jìn qù。\nadd them in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 651520,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "再把盖子盖回来。\nzài bǎ gài zi gài huí lái。\nThen put the lid back on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 655827,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "现在我要加配菜，\nxiàn zài wǒ yào jiā pèi cài，\nNow I’m going to add the side dishes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 658547,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我把配菜也加进我的粉里面。\nwǒ bǎ pèi cài yě jiā jìn wǒ de fěn lǐ miàn。\nI’m adding the side dishes into my noodles too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 665162,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "现在锅里有所有的东西，\nxiàn zài guō lǐ yǒu suǒ yǒu de dōng xī，\nNow the pot has everything in it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 669162,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我用筷子搅拌，\nwǒ yòng kuài zǐ jiǎo bàn，\nI stir with chopsticks,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 671322,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "用筷子搅拌它，\nyòng kuài zǐ jiǎo bàn tā，\nstir it with chopsticks,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 675256,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "搅拌一下。\njiǎo bàn yī xià。\ngive it a stir."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 677256,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "然后我再把火，\nrán hòu wǒ zài bǎ huǒ，\nThen I’ll turn the heat,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 680536,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我再把煤气的火开大一点，\nwǒ zài bǎ méi qì de huǒ kāi dà yī diǎn，\nI’ll turn up the gas flame a little more,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 684216,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "把煤气的火开大。\nbǎ méi qì de huǒ kāi dà。\nturn up the gas flame."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 689256,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "让它再煮三十秒，\nràng tā zài zhǔ sān shí miǎo，\nlet it cook for another thirty seconds,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 692376,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "再煮三十秒就可以吃了。\nzài zhǔ sān shí miǎo jiù kě yǐ chī le。\nit’ll be ready to eat after another thirty seconds."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 697444,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "好啦，我现在可以关火，\nhǎo lā， wǒ xiàn zài kě yǐ guān huǒ，\nAlright, now I can turn off the heat,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 700484,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "关火了。我\nguān huǒ le。 wǒ\nthe heat is off. I"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 702097,
    "dDurationMs": 2481,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我把煤气的火关掉了。\nwǒ bǎ méi qì de huǒ guān diào le。\nI turned off the gas flame."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 704977,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "现在我的螺丝粉就煮好啦，\nxiàn zài wǒ de luó sī fěn jiù zhǔ hǎo lā，\nNow my luosifen is cooked,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 709137,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我准备可以吃了。\nwǒ zhǔn bèi kě yǐ chī le。\nI’m ready to eat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 711990,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我现在把煮好的螺蛳粉，\nwǒ xiàn zài bǎ zhǔ hǎo de luó sī fěn，\nNow I’m taking the cooked luosifen,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 715670,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "把这个小锅拿走，\nbǎ zhè gè xiǎo guō ná zǒu，\ntaking this small pot away,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 718870,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "拿到吃饭的地方。\nná dào chī fàn de dì fāng。\nbringing it to the eating area."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 721580,
    "dDurationMs": 2330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我把小锅拿走，\nwǒ bǎ xiǎo guō ná zǒu，\nI’m taking the small pot away,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 725030,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "拿到吃饭的桌子。\nná dào chī fàn de zhuō zǐ。\nbringing it to the dining table."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 728710,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我把它放在桌子上。\nwǒ bǎ tā fàng zài zhuō zǐ shàng。\nI put it on the table."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 733510,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "然后我准备在这里吃我的螺蛳粉。\nrán hòu wǒ zhǔn bèi zài zhè lǐ chī wǒ de luó sī fěn。\nThen I’m ready to eat my luosifen here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 739452,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "因为螺丝粉很辣，\nyīn wèi luó sī fěn hěn là，\nBecause luosifen is very spicy,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 742812,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "它吃起来很辣，\ntā chī qǐ lái hěn là，\nit tastes very spicy,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 745612,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "所以我要准备一些喝的。\nsuǒ yǐ wǒ yào zhǔn bèi yī xiē hē de。\nso I need to get something to drink ready."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 749692,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这是一个杯子，\nzhè shì yí gè bēi zǐ，\nThis is a cup,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 752252,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "杯子，这是一个杯子。\nbēi zǐ， zhè shì yí gè bēi zǐ。\na cup, this is a cup."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 755045,
    "dDurationMs": 3933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我准备了一罐水果酒，\nwǒ zhǔn bèi le yī guàn shuǐ guǒ jiǔ，\nI prepared a can of fruit wine,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 759212,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这是一罐，一罐水果酒。\nzhè shì yī guàn， yī guàn shuǐ guǒ jiǔ。\nthis is a can, a can of fruit wine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 764092,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我打算把它倒进\nwǒ dǎ suàn bǎ tā dǎo jìn\nI’m going to pour it into"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 767006,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "倒进我的杯子里。\ndǎo jìn wǒ de bēi zǐ lǐ。\npour it into my cup."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 769984,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "它是一个易拉罐，\ntā shì yí gè yì lā guàn，\nIt’s a can,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 772812,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "易拉罐。我把它打开，\nyì lā guàn。 wǒ bǎ tā dǎ kāi，\na can. I’ll open it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 776092,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "把这罐水果酒打开，\nbǎ zhè guàn shuǐ guǒ jiǔ dǎ kāi，\nopen this can of fruit wine,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 781692,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "然后把它倒进杯子里。\nrán hòu bǎ tā dǎo jìn bēi zǐ lǐ。\nthen pour it into the cup."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 786361,
    "dDurationMs": 960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "干米粉\ngān mǐ fěn\ndry rice noodles"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 788400,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这样我就有喝的东西了，\nzhè yàng wǒ jiù yǒu hē de dōng xī le，\nThat way I have something to drink,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 791524,
    "dDurationMs": 2476,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我有一杯水果酒。\nwǒ yǒu yī bēi shuǐ guǒ jiǔ。\nI have a cup of fruit wine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 796033,
    "dDurationMs": 4728,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我的螺蛳粉宵夜就做好了，\nwǒ de luó sī fěn xiāo yè jiù zuò hǎo le，\nMy luosifen late-night snack is ready,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 801036,
    "dDurationMs": 3005,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我准备开动啦。\nwǒ zhǔn bèi kāi dòng lā。\nI’m ready to dig in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 805348,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "螺丝粉的味道很特别，\nluó sī fěn de wèi dào hěn tè bié，\nLuosifen has a very distinctive smell,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 809268,
    "dDurationMs": 5360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "有些人觉得它闻起来很香，\nyǒu xiē rén jué de tā wén qǐ lái hěn xiāng，\nsome people think it smells fragrant,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 814788,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "很好吃，但是有些人觉得\nhěn hǎo chī， dàn shì yǒu xiē rén jué de\nit tastes delicious, but some people think"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 819582,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "螺丝粉闻起来很臭，\nluó sī fěn wén qǐ lái hěn chòu，\nluosifen smells stinky,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 823828,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "闻起来不好闻，\nwén qǐ lái bù hǎo wén，\nit doesn’t smell good,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 825908,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "很臭，所以也有一些人\nhěn chòu， suǒ yǐ yě yǒu yī xiē rén\nreally stinky, so some people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 829789,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "不爱吃螺丝粉。\nbù ài chī luó sī fěn。\ndon’t like to eat luosifen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 833588,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "你有没有尝试过中国的\nnǐ yǒu méi yǒu cháng shì guò zhōng guó de\nHave you ever tried Chinese"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 838048,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "螺丝粉？你看了这个视频会想\nluó sī fěn ？ nǐ kàn le zhè gè shì pín huì xiǎng\nluosifen? After watching this video, would you want"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 843268,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "尝试一下吗？\ncháng shì yī xià ma ？\nto try it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 845668,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "在你的国家有没有哪些食物\nzài nǐ de guó jiā yǒu méi yǒu něi xiē shí wù\nAre there any foods in your country"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 850324,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "也是味道很特别的？\nyě shì wèi dào hěn tè bié de ？\nthat also have a very distinctive smell?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 854228,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "可以在下面的评论区告诉我。\nkě yǐ zài xià miàn de píng lùn qū gào sù wǒ。\nTell me in the comments below."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 859588,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "谢谢你观看这期视频，\nxiè xiè nǐ guān kàn zhè qī shì pín，\nThanks for watching this video,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 863282,
    "dDurationMs": 4226,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我现在要享受我的宵夜了，\nwǒ xiàn zài yào xiǎng shòu wǒ de xiāo yè le，\nI’m going to enjoy my late-night snack now,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 867908,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "下个视频再见，\nxià gè shì pín zài jiàn，\nsee you in the next video,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 870308,
    "dDurationMs": 880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "拜拜。\nbài bài。\nbye-bye."
    } ]
  } ]
